# Test artifacts. The temporal-worker entrypoint installs anything found in
# /app/e2e/fixtures/ as a plugin (when ARK_E2E_MODE=1); leaving them out of
# prod build contexts is defense-in-depth so an image built without the
# ARK_E2E_MODE gate still can't shadow the real claude-code executor.
# The e2e docker-compose bind-mounts ../e2e/fixtures into the container at
# runtime so tests still see them.
e2e/
**/__tests__/
**/*.test.ts
